# Use case diagrams

The actors are the roles of SAD section 3. Each use case carries the user story that covers it. `US-01` (log in) comes before every staff use case and is not drawn. `US-34` (shortage alert) is blocked until the SAD adds donor consent, a channel and a donor location, so it is not drawn either.

Mermaid has no native use case notation. Actors are boxes, use cases are ovals, and the outer box is the system boundary. Dashed arrows are `«include»` and `«extend»`.

