Notes:

- A facility admin manages only the staff of their own institution. A system admin manages any.
- The three assistant use cases (US-36 to US-38) are read-only. The chatbot never writes. A card only opens a screen (SAD 5.7).
- The content reviewer is never the content author, and the policy approver is never the policy author (SAD 11.2).
